{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Function","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"samSelectDetailRegion"}],"externalID":"c:@F@samSelectDetailRegion","symbolKind":"func","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"samSelectDetailRegion"}],"modules":[{"name":"DotFaceCore"}],"title":"samSelectDetailRegion"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/samSelectDetailRegion"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/dotfacecore\/samselectdetailregion"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"preciseIdentifier":"c:I","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"int"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samSelectDetailRegion"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"const"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@sam_color_image","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SamColorImage","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/sam_color_image"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"const"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:I","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"int"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"detectedObjectBoundingBox"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:I","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"int"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"selectedBoundingBox"},{"kind":"text","text":");"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"0 on success, or a non-zero error code on failure.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Analyzes the input image and identifies the most suitable 200x200 pixel","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"region (bounding box) with high level of details that intersects a given bounding box.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"code":"detectedObjectBoundingBox","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is empty (width or height is 0), any region can be selected. Otherwise,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the selected region should have non-empty intersection with this bounding box. The selected region","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should lie fully inside the input image.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If there is no region satisfying these conditions - if image width or height is smaller than 200","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"code":"detectedObjectBoundingBox","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" lies outside the image, the selected bounding box will be (0, 0, 200, 200).","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["                                  a bounding box in the format (x, y, width, height)."]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["                                  return, contains the bounding box in the format (x, y, width, height),","                                  where width and height are always set to 200."]}]}],"references":{"doc://DotFaceCore/documentation/DotFaceCore":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"version: 9.11.0","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/dotfacecore","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore","title":"DotFaceCore"},"doc://DotFaceCore/documentation/DotFaceCore/sam_color_image":{"abstract":[],"title":"sam_color_image","url":"\/documentation\/dotfacecore\/sam_color_image","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/sam_color_image","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"sam_color_image"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://DotFaceCore/documentation/DotFaceCore/samSelectDetailRegion":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/dotfacecore\/samselectdetailregion","title":"samSelectDetailRegion","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/samSelectDetailRegion","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"samSelectDetailRegion","kind":"identifier"}]}}}